---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro'
import PageHero from '@/components/PageHero.astro'
import { contact } from '@/lib/site'
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How Harbison Standard collects, uses, and protects personal information, and your privacy rights in California.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" intro="This policy explains what we collect when you use this site and contact us, and what you can do about it." crumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]} />
  <section class="bg-background py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="shell max-w-3xl space-y-10 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-foreground">Who we are</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Harbison Standard is the real estate practice of Nathanael Harbison, REALTOR®, California DRE #{contact.dre}, serving Tehachapi, Bakersfield, and Kern County, California. You can reach us at {contact.phone} or {contact.email}.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-foreground">What we collect</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li><strong class="text-foreground">Inquiries you send us:</strong> your name, email address, phone number, and any details you choose to give: goal, desired area, budget, timeline, financing status, property type, bedrooms, acreage, optional age range, and your message.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-foreground">Site analytics:</strong> pages you view, the site that referred you, your device and browser type, and approximate location (country, region, and city). We hash your IP address with a daily changing key and do not store the raw address.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-foreground">Browser storage:</strong> a session identifier that clears when you close the tab, and a setting if you opt out of analytics.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-foreground">How we use it</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">To answer your inquiry, follow up on it, keep a record of our conversations, and understand which pages are useful. We do not use your information for advertising, and we do not send marketing email or text messages.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-foreground">Who processes it</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We use service providers to run the site and handle inquiries: an email delivery service for inquiry notifications, a database provider for our client records, our website host, and an analytics provider. These providers process information on our behalf. We do not sell personal information, and we do not share it for cross-context behavioral advertising.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Our analytics provider honors the Do Not Track setting in your browser. Our hosting provider and its content delivery network may add their own performance and security tools to pages.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-foreground">How long we keep it</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We keep inquiries for as long as needed to respond and to keep the records real estate law requires. Analytics data is kept in aggregate and is not tied to a named person.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-foreground">Your California privacy rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">California residents may ask us to tell them what personal information we hold about them, to correct it, or to delete it. You may also opt out of analytics at any time using the link in the footer. We will not discriminate against you for exercising these rights. To make a request, email {contact.email} or call {contact.phone}. We will verify your identity before acting on it.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-foreground">Children</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">This site is not directed to children under 16, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-foreground">Changes</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">If we change this policy, we will update this page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
